{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現代人生活節奏急促且飲食不定時，容易令胃部變得敏感脆弱，引發各種腸胃不適。TVB節目《流行都市》邀請了註冊中醫陳倩如，探討常見的胃部問題。醫師指從中醫角度分析，胃部不適主要可分為「肝胃不和」、「飲食傷胃」及「脾胃虛寒」三大證型，並特別推介了相應的舒緩茶飲與日常護胃穴位。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">「玻璃胃」並非正式的醫學名詞，多數用作形容臨床上胃部防禦力低、非常敏感脆弱猶如玻璃般的情況，常見於生活壓力大、飲食不規律的現代都市人。其常見症狀包括胃脹、胃痛、胃酸倒流、嗝氣及飽滯。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">中醫認為「玻璃胃」屬於胃失和降、胃氣不調、脾胃失調的情況。胃以降為順，以通為用，當胃氣變得不通暢甚至逆行向上，就會出現各種胃部不適，對應西醫即為功能性消化不良或慢性胃炎。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ea56d18b-d181-464d-ac2f-33dd235414b8.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026RoDwAipV7A1784778758.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ea56d18b-d181-464d-ac2f-33dd235414b8.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>3大體質易患玻璃胃與相應治療</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">中醫將「玻璃胃」歸類為內科胃痞、胃痛範疇，主要有以下三種易患體質：</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">肝胃不和</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">飲食傷胃</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">脾胃虛寒</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul></li></ol><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>中醫推薦3款舒緩茶飲</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">針對上述三種證型，中醫師推介了三款相應的舒緩茶飲：</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">玫瑰陳皮茶</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">材料：陳皮1瓣、玫瑰花10克</p></li><li></li><li></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳皮山楂紅棗茶</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">材料：陳皮1瓣、山楂乾10克、紅棗2粒</p></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">飲用注意：胃酸過多者及孕婦不宜飲用。</p></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黑糖薑棗茶</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">材料：生薑5片、紅棗4粒、黑糖15克</p></li><li></li><li></li></ul></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4abec400-72df-4468-bcee-605a42eab66a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026fscksHB7a71784778763.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4abec400-72df-4468-bcee-605a42eab66a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>2大護胃穴位按壓</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">中醫推薦兩個日常護胃穴位以舒緩胃部不適：</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">足三里</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">內關穴</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></li></ol><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>日常養胃3大貼士</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">容易有「玻璃胃」的人士在日常生活中需留意以下事項：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">**本節目內主持及嘉賓的言論純屬個人意見並不代表本台立場。此內容僅供參考。如需獲得醫療意見或診斷，請諮詢專業人士。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T13:18:42.653880+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":638,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}